// Copy of g1-fw/models/Nordic_NPM1300.cs (commit b8ec262) with one change for this project
// (2026-10-22): KeepTimerOnSocReset. On hardware a SoC reset (SYSRESETREQ, WDT0) does not reset the
// nPM1300, so its watchdog keeps counting into MCUboot; only its own power cycle (or a power loss)
// clears it. Renode resets every peripheral with the machine, so with the property on, a machine
// reset that is not this model's own power cycle keeps the TIMER block and the time left.
//
.
